---
---
<section id="featured-programs" class="programs-cyber section">
  <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up">
    <div class="cyber-section-header">
      <span class="cyber-section-tag">SPECIALTIES</span>
      <h2 class="cyber-section-title">專業整合 · <em>貼近人心</em></h2>
      <p style="margin-top:14px;color:rgba(232,224,213,0.48);font-size:0.92rem;max-width:520px;">
        從臨床護理到保險顧問，結合心理學、MMT 與靈性覺察，打造最貼近人心的支持與保障。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="80">
    <div class="isotope-layout" data-default-filter="*" data-layout="masonry" data-sort="original-order">

      <!-- Filters -->
      <ul class="cyber-filter-bar isotope-filters" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        <li data-filter="*" class="filter-active">ALL</li>
        <li data-filter=".filter-bachelor">MMT</li>
        <li data-filter=".filter-master">護理照護</li>
        <li data-filter=".filter-certificate">富邦保險</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="row g-3 isotope-container">

        <!-- 天賦11 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="program-cyber-card">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper" style="min-height:200px;">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt11.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt11.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦11" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦11｜權威者】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> 天秤座</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> 雅典娜型</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>對知識有高度渴望，崇尚公平與正義，擅長中立判斷。條理清晰、擅長資訊整合與專業輸出，注重制度與秩序。</p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn"><span>Learn More</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦17 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="180">
          <div class="program-cyber-card">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper" style="min-height:200px;">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt17.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt17.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦17" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦17｜理想家】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> 水瓶座</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> 澤菲羅斯型</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>求知慾旺盛、好奇心強，崇尚自由與創意，時常走在時代前端。具備「臨門一腳」的媒合智慧，喜歡成就他人。</p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn"><span>Learn More</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦2 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="260">
          <div class="program-cyber-card">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper" style="min-height:200px;">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt2.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt2.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦2" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦2｜敏銳者】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> 巨蟹座</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> 赫拉型</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>情感細膩、具高度共感能力，善於傾聽，能接住他人的情緒。重視親密關係中的安全感與承諾，具有溫柔而堅定的情緒支撐力量。</p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn"><span>Learn More</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦19 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="260">
          <div class="program-cyber-card">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper" style="min-height:200px;">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt19.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt19.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦19" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦19｜光之子】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> 獅子座</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> 阿波羅型</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>散發光芒，擁有強烈的自我意識與影響力。極具目標感與行動力，天生具備領袖氣質，善於感召與鼓舞。本質溫暖、正向，有療癒感染他人的力量。</p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn"><span>Learn More</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 天賦6 -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 isotope-item filter-bachelor" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="260">
          <div class="program-cyber-card">
            <div class="program-badge">MMT</div>
            <div class="row g-0">
              <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="program-image-wrapper" style="min-height:200px;">
                  <a href="/img/mmt/mmt6.png" class="glightbox" data-gallery="mmt">
                    <img src="/img/mmt/mmt6.png" class="img-fluid" alt="天賦6" />
                  </a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-8">
                <div class="program-content">
                  <h3>【天賦6｜演譯家】</h3>
                  <div class="program-highlights">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-stars"></i> 雙子座</span>
                    <span><i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i> 邱比特型</span>
                  </div>
                  <p>情感細膩、觀察入微，是天生的情緒翻譯者。能讀懂他人未說出口的情緒，在關係中渴望深度連結，遊走於理性感知與感性覺察之間。</p>
                  <a href="#" class="program-btn"><span>Learn More</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
